{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3016080/extras/getToWorkText.png?t=1722274965\" /><br><br>The platformer where you're broke!<br><i>Slime Voyage</i> is a 2D-Platformer where you travel the world working odd jobs to get paid.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3016080/extras/slimeSpinResCrop.gif?t=1722274965\" /><br><br><i>So what's the plan...?</i><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3016080/extras/getSlimey.png?t=1722274965\" /><br><br>You're a slime. Your goal? Some really, like <i><strong>REALLY</strong></i> cool sunglasses\u2122.<br>Work odd jobs to fund your dream and try not to destroy everything along the way.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3016080/extras/gameplayTrim.gif?t=1722274965\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3016080/extras/getToWorkStep.png?t=1722274965\" /><br><br>To fund his dreams, Slime takes up all kinds of job offers.<br>From <i>investigating the disappearance of a cult leader in a bottomless pit</i>, to a relaxing afternoon trimming the hedges of an overgrown flower garden...<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3016080/extras/gotAJob.gif?t=1722274965\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3016080/extras/getPaid.png?t=1722274965\" /><br><br>Reap the sweet rewards!<br><br>Use your hard-earned money to splurge on house accessories, access secret worlds, and snatch those - really, like <strong><i>REALLY</i></strong> cool sunglasses\u2122.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3016080/extras/wow.gif?t=1722274965\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3016080/extras/featuresText.png?t=1722274965\" /><br><br> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Satisfying, precise platforming.<br> </li><li>Silly lil' guys...<br> </li><li>Breaking it down.<br> </li><li>Original soundtrack with the most <i>fonkiest music.</i><br> </li><li>Beautiful, yet smooth pixel art.<br> </li><li>Starring in a <i>dating sim?!</i><br> </li><li>Minimum wage!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3016080/extras/elevatorFallLoop.gif?t=1722274965\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3016080/extras/coldEnd.gif?t=1722274965\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3016080/extras/whatAreYouStill.png?t=1722274965\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3016080/extras/getBackToWork.png?t=1722274965\" /></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3016080?t=1722274965","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3016080?t=1722274965","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3016080/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1722274965","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3016080/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1722274965","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3016080/extras/getToWorkText.png?t=1722274965\" /><br><br>The platformer where you're broke!<br><i>Slime Voyage</i> is a 2D-Platformer where you travel the world working odd jobs to